SECTION 1: STATUTORY CLASSIFICATION OF THE WORK
================================================================================
This repository, its underlying architecture, documentation, and digital assets
constitute a composite intellectual creation legally classified under The Copyright
Act, 2023 (২০২৩ সনের ৩৪ নং আইন) of the People's Republic of Bangladesh as:

1.1 "তথ্য প্রযুক্তি-ভিত্তিক ডিজিটাল কর্ম" (Information Technology-Based Digital Work)
    pursuant to Section 2(10) and Section 14(1)(b), comprising all source code,
    TypeScript/JavaScript logic, Next.js architecture, component engines,
    browser runtime sandboxes, procedural sound synthesis, and data schemas.

1.2 "সাহিত্যকর্ম" (Literary Work) pursuant to Section 2(50) and Section 14(1)(a),
    comprising the "Project: Website" field-manual series, curriculum design,
    chapter narratives, pedagogical exercises, and instructional text.

1.3 "শিল্পকর্ম" (Artistic Work) pursuant to Section 2(40) and Section 14(1)(c),
    comprising the "Blocku" vector mascot, user interface design layouts,
    custom typography configurations, print worksheet layouts, and SVG assets.

